  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">DeployCloud Blog · Engineering and platform stories</span>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1>Discover the latest in web development.</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">Insights from the teams building cloud infrastructure, AI agents, developer tooling, and the deployment platform behind modern software.</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="Agentic infrastructure statistics">
            <span class="panel-label">Agentic infrastructure</span>
            <p class="panel-number">30%</p>
            <p class="panel-copy">of deployments on DeployCloud are now initiated by coding agents, a 1000% increase from six months ago.</p>
            <div class="mini-stats"><div class="mini-stat"><strong>20×</strong><span>more likely to call AI inference</span></div><div class="mini-stat"><strong>2×</strong><span>weekly deployments in three months</span></div></div>
